      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ŋikaeok ŋulu ka Akai ka Akuj",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 25:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apotu Daudi kaapei ka ŋikarikok ŋulu a ŋasigarya toseut ŋidwe ka Asap, Eman ka Yedusun ŋulusapa ŋice aŋuna ka akisera ŋakiro ka Akuj kisitiyaete ŋiboro ŋulu eramio eeoi lu: Ŋaduŋgui, ŋagitae ka ŋitworoi. Ŋirorwa a ŋituŋa a ŋul ikes lu: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 25:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aneni a ŋidwe ka Asap a ŋulusapa, aponi toseunae Sakur, Yosepu, Nesania ka Asarela. Arae Asap apolokinit ŋidwe keŋ ŋulu eseraete ŋakiro ka Akuj ŋinapaki daadaŋ iŋitakinia erwosit ikes akitiya ŋun. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 25:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aneni a ŋidwe a Yedusun a ŋulusapa, aponi toseunae Gedalia, Seri, Yesaia, Simei ka Asabia ta Matisia. Arae papa kec apolokinit ikes iseraete ŋakiro ka Akuj kisitiyaete anaeo kec ŋaduŋgui alakaror neni ke Ekapolon ka akipuror Ekapolon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 25:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aneni a ŋidwe ke Eman a ŋulusapa, aponi toseunae Bukia, Matania, Usiel, Subael, Yerimos, Amania, Anani, Eliasa, Gidalti, Romamti-Eser, Yosibekasa, Malosi ka Osir ta Maasios. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 25:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arae ŋul daadaŋ ŋidwe ke Eman ŋulusapa, ido arae Eman eteyenenakini erwosit ŋakiro ŋuna eponito. Ainakinio Eman ŋidwe ŋul alotooma akiikinet ka Akuj aŋuna ka akitopoloor iŋes. Abu Akuj inak Eman ŋidwe ŋulusapa ŋitomon ka ŋiomwon ka ŋulupesur ŋiuni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 25:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arae papa kec apolokinit ŋisapa ŋul daadaŋ eeosi alo Kai ka Akuj neni ke Ekapolon, isitiyaete ŋitworoi, ŋagitae ka ŋaduŋgui anakilip alo Kai ka Akuj. Nai arae erwosit apolokinit Asap ka Yedusun ta Eman. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 25:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Etatamitae ikes daadaŋ ka ŋiyeneta kec aeore, ido ayenete nooi aeore aŋuna ke Ekapolon. Arae ekimar kec ŋamiae ŋaarei ka ŋatomonikanikauni ka ŋakanikauni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 25:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ayakasi kidiŋ kec ŋisorok kaapei ka ŋikasikou, ŋiketatamak kaapei ka ŋulu etatamyo, esitiyaete ikes daadaŋ akilamilam aseunia alokidiŋ kec ŋulu itiyaete.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
