              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akilamilamakinet ŋina esyaunan, ŋina arae ŋina a ŋiletok ka Asap, abu min neni a Yosepu ka ŋidwe keŋ ŋulusapa ta ŋiyeneta keŋ, arae ŋul daadaŋ ŋitomon ka ŋiarei, ŋina a ŋaarei abu min neni a Gedalia ka ŋidwe keŋ ŋulusapa ta ŋiyeneta keŋ arae ŋul daadaŋ ŋitomon ka ŋiarei, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
