          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ŋina a ŋauni abu min neni a Sakur ka ŋidwe keŋ ŋulusapa ta ŋiyeneta keŋ, arae ŋul daadaŋ ŋitomon ka ŋiarei, ",
          "type": "text",
